     ('Alarms (self-catering benchmark)',['Smoke alarm in the hall, or in both the ground floor hall and first floor landing in a two-storey property','Every bedroom door within 3 m of a smoke alarm, and no part of a hall or corridor more than 7.5 m from one','Smoke alarm in each living room and separate dining room','Heat alarm in the kitchen','Smoke alarm in each bedroom if there are more than three bedrooms','Optical type smoke alarms in halls and landings','Alarms interlinked (wired or wire-free)','Powered by a long-life tamper-proof lithium battery, or mains with a battery or capacitor backup','Carbon monoxide detection fitted (a mandatory licence condition)','System in place to test and maintain the alarms']),
